metric">Geometric</a><a class="px-6 py-3 border border-gray-light hover:border-brand-red transition-all font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest bg-white" href="/gallery?style=fine line">Fine Line</a><a class="px-6 py-3 border border-gray-light hover:border-brand-red transition-all font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest bg-white" href="/gallery?style=minimalist">Minimalist</a></div><div class="px-8 lg:px-24 flex justify-center"><a class="w-full max-w-[1200px] h-14 bg-brand-red text-white flex items-center justify-center font-mono text-[14px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] hover:bg-black transition-colors rounded-none" href="/gallery">BROWSE ALL DESIGNS</a></div></section><section id="meaning-section" class="py-24 px-8 lg:px-24 border-b border-gray-light bg-off-white scroll-mt-24"><h2 class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gray-mid mb-16">EVERY DESIGN HAS A STORY</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 mb-16"><div class="flex flex-col bg-white border border-gray-light"><img alt="split tiger and hannya mask" loading="lazy" width="400" height="533" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full aspect-[3/4] object-contain p-4 bg-white border-b border-gray-light" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 400px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-split-tiger-and-hannya-mask-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-split-tiger-and-hannya-mask-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-split-tiger-and-hannya-mask-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-split-tiger-and-hannya-mask-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-split-tiger-and-hannya-mask-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-split-tiger-and-hannya-mask-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-split-tiger-and-hannya-mask-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-split-tiger-and-hannya-mask-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-split-tiger-and-hannya-mask-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><div class="p-8"><h3 class="font-display text-2xl mb-4 uppercase">split tiger and hannya mask</h3><p class="text-[14px] text-gray-mid leading-relaxed mb-6 line-clamp-3">This design illustrates the &#x27;beast within,&#x27; juxtaposing the domestic familiar cat with the Hannya mask, which symbolizes jealous rage and demonic transformation in Japanese folklore. It suggests a hidden depth of ferocity and supernatural protection lurking beneath a calm exterior. The fragmentation of the mask around the central feline face represents a psychic shattering or the breaking of a social veneer.</p><div class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-brand-red mb-6">This design is a modern Neo-Japanese interpretation of traditional Irezumi motifs, specifically the Hannya mask from Noh theater.</div><a class="font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] border-b border-black pb-1 hover:text-brand-red hover:border-brand-red transition-all" href="/gallery/split-tiger-and-hannya-mask">Read Full Story</a></div></div><div class="flex flex-col bg-white border border-gray-light"><img alt="skeletal court jester holding a smiling mask with eight-ball charms" loading="lazy" width="400" height="533" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full aspect-[3/4] object-contain p-4 bg-white border-b border-gray-light" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 400px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-skeletal-court-jester-holding-a-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-skeletal-court-jester-holding-a-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-skeletal-court-jester-holding-a-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-skeletal-court-jester-holding-a-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-skeletal-court-jester-holding-a-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-skeletal-court-jester-holding-a-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-skeletal-court-jester-holding-a-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-skeletal-court-jester-holding-a-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-skeletal-court-jester-holding-a-illustrative-cm.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><div class="p-8"><h3 class="font-display text-2xl mb-4 uppercase">skeletal court jester holding a smiling mask with eight-ball charms</h3><p class="text-[14px] text-gray-mid leading-relaxed mb-6 line-clamp-3">This design represents the &#x27;Danse Macabre&#x27; or the Dance of Death, signifying the mockery of mortality and the idea that death is the ultimate equalizer regardless of social status. The jester specifically symbolizes the subversion of reality, while the mask and skeletal reveal highlight the duality between the personas we project and the inevitable decay beneath. The incorporation of 8-balls suggests a fatalistic view of luck and the finality of life&#x27;s game.</p><div class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-brand-red mb-6">Late Medieval European &#x27;Danse Macabre&#x27; traditions blended with contemporary Dark Illustrative tattoo aesthetics.</div><a class="font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] border-b border-black pb-1 hover:text-brand-red hover:border-brand-red transition-all" href="/gallery/skeletal-court-jester-holding-a">Read Full Story</a></div></div><div class="flex flex-col bg-white border border-gray-light"><img alt="Japanese samurai cat with kabuto and katana" loading="lazy" width="400" height="533" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full aspect-[3/4] object-contain p-4 bg-white border-b border-gray-light" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 400px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-japanese-samurai-cat-with-kabuto-illustrative-aw.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-japanese-samurai-cat-with-kabuto-illustrative-aw.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-japanese-samurai-cat-with-kabuto-illustrative-aw.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-japanese-samurai-cat-with-kabuto-illustrative-aw.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-japanese-samurai-cat-with-kabuto-illustrative-aw.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-japanese-samurai-cat-with-kabuto-illustrative-aw.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-japanese-samurai-cat-with-kabuto-illustrative-aw.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-japanese-samurai-cat-with-kabuto-illustrative-aw.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsmrnldmbvtflavzswghh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fdesigns%2Ffine-line-japanese-samurai-cat-with-kabuto-illustrative-aw.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><div class="p-8"><h3 class="font-display text-2xl mb-4 uppercase">Japanese samurai cat with kabuto and katana</h3><p class="text-[14px] text-gray-mid leading-relaxed mb-6 line-clamp-3">This design represents the &#x27;Neko-Samurai,&#x27; blending the protective, cunning nature of the cat with the Bushido code of honor and resilience. The inclusion of the Daruma doll at the base signifies unyielding perseverance—specifically the &#x27;fall seven times, stand up eight&#x27; philosophy—while the cherry blossoms symbolize the ephemeral nature of life. It serves as a talisman for a warrior&#x27;s spirit that remains playful yet disciplined in the face of transience.</p><div class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-brand-red mb-6">Japanese Neo-Traditional (Modern Irezumi) drawing from Edo-period ukiyo-e aesthetics and folklore.</div><a class="font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] border-b border-black pb-1 hover:text-brand-red hover:border-brand-red transition-all" href="/gallery/japanese-samurai-cat-with-kabuto">Read Full Story</a></div></div></div><div class="w-full text-center font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gray-mid">MEANING DOCUMENTED FOR EVERY DESIGN IN OUR LIBRARY</div></section><section class="py-24 px-8 lg:px-24 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-24 border-b border-gray-light items-center"><div><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-brand-red uppercase tracking-[0.3em] block mb-6">FEATURE</span><h2 class="font-display text-[48px] md:text-[60px] leading-[1] mb-8 uppercase tracking-tighter">SEE IT ON YOUR SKIN<br/><span class="text-gray-mid">BEFORE THE NEEDLE</span></h2><p class="text-[18px] text-gray-mid leading-relaxed max-w-[480px] mb-12">Upload your photo. Select any design from our library. Our compositor places the exact design on your exact body — no AI hallucinations, no altered photos, just precise placement.</p><ul class="space-y-6 mb-12"><li class="flex items-center space-x-4 font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-wide"><span class="text-brand-red text-xl">✓</span><span>100% free to use — no credit card or account required</span></li><li class="flex items-center space-x-4 font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-wide"><span class="text-brand-red text-xl">✓</span><span>Fast &amp; easy — preview any design on your body in seconds</span></li></ul><a class="inline-flex h-14 px-12 bg-brand-red text-white items-center font-mono text-[14px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] hover:bg-black transition-colors rounded-none" href="/try-on">TRY THE STUDIO</a></div><div class="relative group overflow-hidden border border-gray-light bg-off-white aspect-square"><div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-1/2 w-0.5 bg-brand-red z-10"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 grid grid-cols-2 h-full"><div class="h-full bg-[url(&#x27;/lab/samurai-cat-design.webp&#x27;)] bg-contain bg-center bg-no-repeat bg-white"></div><div class="h-full bg-[url(&#x27;/lab/samurai-cat-fresh.webp&#x27;)] bg-cover bg-center"></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase text-white bg-black px-4 py-2 z-20">TATTOO DESIGN</div><div class="absolute bottom-6 right-6 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase text-white bg-brand-red px-4 py-2 z-20">COMPOSITOR OUTPUT</div></div></section><section class="py-24 px-8 lg:px-24 bg-off-white border-b border-gray-light"><h2 class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-brand-red mb-16 px-4">THE SCIENCE YOUR ARTIST SKIPPED</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-0 border border-gray-light"><div class="p-12 bg-white border-r last:border-r-0 border-gray-light"><div class="font-display text-5xl md:text-6xl mb-4 text-black">14</div><div class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-red mb-8">CRITICAL DAYS</div><p class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-gray-mid">The first 14 days determine whether your tattoo design holds its precision for decades or fades within a year.</p></div><div class="p-12 bg-white border-r last:border-r-0 border-gray-light"><div class="font-display text-5xl md:text-6xl mb-4 text-black">60%</div><div class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-red mb-8">OF LOTIONS</div><p class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-gray-mid">Contain compounds that accelerate ink migration in the dermis during the healing phase. Most artists never mention this.</p></div><div class="p-12 bg-white border-r last:border-r-0 border-gray-light"><div class="font-display text-5xl md:text-6xl mb-4 text-black">5×</div><div class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-red mb-8">FASTER FADE</div><p class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-gray-mid">Tattoos on high-friction placements fade 5× faster than the same design on optimal placements.</p></div></div><div class="mt-16 flex justify-center"><a class="font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] border-b border-black pb-1 hover:text-brand-red hover:border-brand-red transition-all" href="/blog/dermatologists-guide-aftercare">READ THE COMPLETE AFTERCARE SCIENCE GUIDE</a></div></section><section class="py-24 px-8 lg:px-24 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-24 border-b border-gray-light bg-white"><div><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-brand-red uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-6 block font-bold">DIRECT ARTIST BOOKING</span><h2 class="font-display text-[48px] md:text-[60px] leading-[1] mb-8 uppercase tracking-tighter">VERIFIED ARTISTS.<br/><span class="text-gray-mid">DIRECT BOOKING.</span></h2><p class="text-[18px] text-gray-mid leading-relaxed max-w-[480px] mb-12">Discover verified tattoo artists on TattoosMap. Browse our vetted catalog of elite creators, find the perfect design style, and connect directly to book your next session with no middleman fees.</p><ul class="space-y-6"><li class="flex items-center space-x-4 font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-wide"><span class="text-brand-red text-xl">/</span><span>Direct booking — connect with verified artists instantly</span></li><li class="flex items-center space-x-4 font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-wide"><span class="text-brand-red text-xl">/</span><span>Explore portfolios — review the unique work of each artist</span></li><li class="flex items-center space-x-4 font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-wide"><span class="text-brand-red text-xl">/</span><span>Vetted directory — only elite, proven creators</span></li></ul></div><div class="p-10 bg-off-white border border-gray-light flex flex-col justify-center"><span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-brand-red uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-2 block font-bold">Artist Registration</span><h3 class="font-display text-2xl uppercase mb-6 leading-tight">Claim Your Vetted Artist Profile</h3><p class="text-[14px] text-gray-mid leading-relaxed mb-8">Are you a professional tattoo artist? Join our vetted directory to showcase your original artwork, get discovered by premium collectors, and receive structured direct bookings through your profile.</p><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><a class="h-14 bg-black text-white font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-brand-red transition-all shadow-md font-bold" href="/artists">Join Directory As Artist</a><a class="h-14 border border-black text-black font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-all font-bold" href="/artists">Explore Vetted Artists</a></div></div></section><footer class="py-24 px-8 lg:px-24 bg-black text-white"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-16 mb-24"><div><h2 class="font-display text-3xl mb-4 tracking-tighter">TattoosMap</h2><div class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-brand-red mb-6">THE CARTOGRAPHER OF INK</div><p class="text-[14px] text-gray-mid leading-relaxed">A global tattoo discovery and trust platform. Precision designs, science-backed care.</p></div><div><h4 class="font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] mb-8 text-white">Explore</h4><ul class="space-y-4 font-mono text-[12px] text-gray-mid uppercase tracking-wide"><li><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/gallery">Gallery</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/gallery">Meaning Search</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/try-on">Try-On Studio</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/design-lab">Design Lab</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class="font-mono